('342', '59', 'G9-U09-GRA-02-Q05', 'Choose the correct shortened form of “The film which they watched was interesting.”', 'The film watched they was interesting.', 'The film they watched was interesting.', 'The film they watching was interesting.', 'The film watched was they interesting.', 'B', '2', 'Đáp án B: The film they watched was interesting.. Dùng theo phạm vi: Nhận diện trường hợp có thể lược bỏ đại từ quan hệ làm tân ngữ trong mệnh đề xác định.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('343', '59', 'G9-U09-GRA-02-Q06', 'In “The podcast which I downloaded yesterday is useful,” what happens if which is omitted?', 'The sentence becomes wrong because which is a subject.', 'The tense of downloaded must change.', 'The sentence remains correct because which is an object.', 'The noun podcast must become plural.', 'C', '2', 'Which là tân ngữ của downloaded, có thể lược bỏ trong mệnh đề xác định.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('344', '59', 'G9-U09-GRA-02-Q07', 'Which relative pronoun can be omitted without changing the meaning?', 'The teacher who helped us was patient.', 'The website that I recommended is free.', 'The application which works offline is useful.', 'The lessons that begin early are popular.', 'B', '2', 'That trong website that I recommended làm tân ngữ nên lược bỏ được; ba trường hợp khác là chủ ngữ.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('345', '59', 'G9-U09-GRA-02-Q08', 'Choose the only sentence in which the relative pronoun has been omitted legally without losing a required subject.', 'The student teaches our class lives nearby.', 'The people speak two languages often travel.', 'The app I installed yesterday works offline.', 'The dictionary contains phonetic symbols is expensive.', 'C', '3', 'The app [that] I installed: that là tân ngữ nên có thể bỏ; ba câu kia bỏ đại từ làm chủ ngữ khiến mệnh đề thiếu chủ ngữ.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('346', '60', 'G9-U09-GRA-03-Q01', 'A woman teaches English. She lives next door. Choose the correct combination.', 'The woman who lives next door teaches English.', 'The woman which lives next door teaches English.', 'The woman who she lives next door teaches English.', 'The woman lives next door who teaches English she.', 'A', '2', 'Đáp án A: The woman who lives next door teaches English.. Dùng theo phạm vi: Kết hợp hai câu bằng mệnh đề quan hệ xác định với trật tự từ phù hợp.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('347', '60', 'G9-U09-GRA-03-Q02', 'I bought a dictionary. It explains phrasal verbs. Choose the correct combination.', 'I bought a dictionary that explains phrasal verbs.', 'I bought a dictionary who explains phrasal verbs.', 'I bought a dictionary explains that phrasal verbs.', 'I bought a dictionary that it explains phrasal verbs.', 'A', '2', 'Đáp án A: I bought a dictionary that explains phrasal verbs.. Dùng theo phạm vi: Kết hợp hai câu bằng mệnh đề quan hệ xác định với trật tự từ phù hợp.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('348', '60', 'G9-U09-GRA-03-Q03', 'I met a student. You helped him yesterday. Choose the correct combination.', 'I met the student which helped you yesterday.', 'I met the student you helped yesterday.', 'I met the student who you helped him yesterday.', 'I met the student helped you yesterday.', 'B', '2', 'Đáp án B: I met the student you helped yesterday.. Dùng theo phạm vi: Kết hợp hai câu bằng mệnh đề quan hệ xác định với trật tự từ phù hợp.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('349', '60', 'G9-U09-GRA-03-Q04', 'The website is useful. It offers free lessons. Choose the correct combination.', 'The website offers which free lessons is useful.', 'The website who offers free lessons is useful.', 'The website which offers free lessons is useful.', 'The website which it offers free lessons is useful.', 'C', '2', 'Đáp án C: The website which offers free lessons is useful.. Dùng theo phạm vi: Kết hợp hai câu bằng mệnh đề quan hệ xác định với trật tự từ phù hợp.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('350', '60', 'G9-U09-GRA-03-Q05', 'The boy won the prize. He speaks three languages. Choose the correct combination.', 'The boy who he speaks three languages won the prize.', 'The boy speaks who three languages won the prize.', 'The boy which speaks three languages won the prize.', 'The boy who speaks three languages won the prize.', 'D', '2', 'Đáp án D: The boy who speaks three languages won the prize.. Dùng theo phạm vi: Kết hợp hai câu bằng mệnh đề quan hệ xác định với trật tự từ phù hợp.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('351', '60', 'G9-U09-GRA-03-Q06', 'A teacher works at our school. She speaks three languages. Choose the correct defining relative clause.', 'The teacher who she speaks three languages works at our school.', 'The teacher which speaks three languages works at our school.', 'The teacher who speaks three languages works at our school.', 'The teacher speaks who three languages works at our school.', 'C', '2', 'Who làm chủ ngữ thay cho teacher; không lặp she.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('352', '60', 'G9-U09-GRA-03-Q07', 'The app is useful. I recommended it to my classmates. Which combination is correct?', 'The app which I recommended it to my classmates is useful.', 'The app that I recommended to my classmates is useful.', 'The app who I recommended to my classmates is useful.', 'The app that I recommended to my classmates it is useful.', 'B', '2', 'That là tân ngữ của recommended; không thêm it thừa.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('370', '63', 'G9-U10-GRA-02-Q01', 'My father, ____ works at the park, studies birds.', 'where', 'that', 'who', 'which', 'C', '1', 'Đáp án C: who. Dùng theo phạm vi: Chọn who/which/whose trong mệnh đề quan hệ không xác định; không dùng that.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('371', '63', 'G9-U10-GRA-02-Q02', 'The Mekong River, ____ flows through several countries, is important.', 'which', 'whose', 'who', 'that', 'A', '1', 'Đáp án A: which. Dùng theo phạm vi: Chọn who/which/whose trong mệnh đề quan hệ không xác định; không dùng that.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('353', '60', 'G9-U09-GRA-03-Q08', 'A dictionary has detailed examples. It was written for teenagers. The teacher recommends it. Choose the sentence that combines the ideas without repeating an object pronoun.', 'The teacher recommends the dictionary which it was written for teenagers and has detailed examples.', 'The teacher recommends the dictionary that was written for teenagers and it has detailed examples.', 'The teacher recommends the dictionary who was written for teenagers and has detailed examples.', 'The teacher recommends the dictionary that was written for teenagers and has detailed examples.', 'D', '3', 'That thay cho dictionary ở cả cụm quan hệ; không lặp it và không dùng who cho vật.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('354', '61', 'G9-U10-VOC-01-Q01', 'A forest is the natural ____ of many animals.', 'workshop', 'habitat', 'salary', 'deadline', 'B', '1', 'Đáp án B: habitat. Dùng theo phạm vi: Từ vựng về hệ sinh thái, sinh vật, môi trường và bảo tồn.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('355', '61', 'G9-U10-VOC-01-Q02', 'Tigers and lions are different ____ of big cats.', 'careers', 'interviews', 'species', 'devices', 'C', '1', 'Đáp án C: species. Dùng theo phạm vi: Từ vựng về hệ sinh thái, sinh vật, môi trường và bảo tồn.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('356', '61', 'G9-U10-VOC-01-Q03', 'When the wetland was drained, several bird, fish and insect species disappeared. The decline in the variety of living things is a loss of ____.', 'biodiversity', 'altitude', 'weather', 'soil fertility', 'A', '2', 'Biodiversity là sự đa dạng các sinh vật; số loài giảm khiến đa dạng sinh học suy giảm.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('357', '61', 'G9-U10-VOC-01-Q04', 'Plants, animals and their environment form an ____.', 'itinerary', 'interview', 'ecosystem', 'workshop', 'C', '1', 'Đáp án C: ecosystem. Dùng theo phạm vi: Từ vựng về hệ sinh thái, sinh vật, môi trường và bảo tồn.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('358', '61', 'G9-U10-VOC-01-Q05', 'Only a few wild turtles remain, and the beaches where they lay eggs are shrinking. Conservationists say the species is ____.', 'domesticated', 'endangered', 'introduced', 'common', 'B', '2', 'Endangered là có nguy cơ tuyệt chủng; số lượng cá thể giảm và mất nơi sinh sản là dấu hiệu nguy cấp.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('359', '61', 'G9-U10-VOC-01-Q06', 'When farmers cut down the forest, many animals lose the places where they feed and reproduce. Their natural ____ is being destroyed.', 'population count', 'migration route', 'weather forecast', 'habitat', 'D', '2', 'Habitat là môi trường sống tự nhiên của động vật, nơi kiếm ăn và sinh sản.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('360', '61', 'G9-U10-VOC-01-Q07', 'A species is described as ____ when only a small number of individuals remain and it faces a high risk of extinction.', 'endangered', 'domesticated', 'abundant', 'introduced', 'A', '2', 'Endangered nghĩa là có nguy cơ tuyệt chủng, khác extinct là đã tuyệt chủng.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('361', '61', 'G9-U10-VOC-01-Q08', 'A wetland is drained to build houses, causing birds to lose nesting sites and fish numbers to fall. Which environmental problem best links these effects?', 'improved biodiversity', 'successful reforestation', 'reduced urban growth', 'habitat loss', 'D', '2', 'San lấp đất ngập nước phá hủy nơi cư trú, gây giảm số lượng chim và cá: habitat loss.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('362', '62', 'G9-U10-GRA-01-Q01', 'Choose the correctly punctuated non-defining relative clause about Ha Long Bay.', 'Ha Long Bay which is in Viet Nam, attracts many visitors.', 'Ha Long Bay, which is in Viet Nam, attracts many visitors.', 'Ha Long Bay, which is in Viet Nam attracts many visitors.', 'Ha Long Bay which is in Viet Nam attracts many visitors.', 'B', '1', 'Đáp án B: Ha Long Bay, which is in Viet Nam, attracts many visitors.. Dùng theo phạm vi: Sử dụng dấu phẩy để tách mệnh đề quan hệ không xác định.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('363', '62', 'G9-U10-GRA-01-Q02', 'Choose the correctly punctuated non-defining relative clause about My uncle.', 'My uncle who is a biologist, studies coral reefs.', 'My uncle, who is a biologist studies coral reefs.', 'My uncle, who is a biologist, studies coral reefs.', 'My uncle who is a biologist studies coral reefs.', 'C', '1', 'Đáp án C: My uncle, who is a biologist, studies coral reefs.. Dùng theo phạm vi: Sử dụng dấu phẩy để tách mệnh đề quan hệ không xác định.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('364', '62', 'G9-U10-GRA-01-Q03', 'Choose the correctly punctuated non-defining relative clause about The Red River.', 'The Red River which runs through Ha Noi, is important.', 'The Red River, which runs through Ha Noi, is important.', 'The Red River, which runs through Ha Noi is important.', 'The Red River which runs through Ha Noi is important.', 'B', '1', 'Đáp án B: The Red River, which runs through Ha Noi, is important.. Dùng theo phạm vi: Sử dụng dấu phẩy để tách mệnh đề quan hệ không xác định.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('365', '62', 'G9-U10-GRA-01-Q04', 'Choose the correctly punctuated non-defining relative clause about Mai.', 'Mai, who loves animals volunteers at the shelter.', 'Mai who loves animals, volunteers at the shelter.', 'Mai, who loves animals, volunteers at the shelter.', 'Mai who loves animals volunteers at the shelter.', 'C', '1', 'Đáp án C: Mai, who loves animals, volunteers at the shelter.. Dùng theo phạm vi: Sử dụng dấu phẩy để tách mệnh đề quan hệ không xác định.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('366', '62', 'G9-U10-GRA-01-Q05', 'Choose the correctly punctuated non-defining relative clause about Mount Fansipan.', 'Mount Fansipan, which is in northern Viet Nam, is a popular destination.', 'Mount Fansipan, which is in northern Viet Nam is a popular destination.', 'Mount Fansipan which is in northern Viet Nam, is a popular destination.', 'Mount Fansipan which is in northern Viet Nam is a popular destination.', 'A', '1', 'Đáp án A: Mount Fansipan, which is in northern Viet Nam, is a popular destination.. Dùng theo phạm vi: Sử dụng dấu phẩy để tách mệnh đề quan hệ không xác định.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('367', '62', 'G9-U10-GRA-01-Q06', 'Choose the sentence with correctly placed commas around extra information about the Amazon River.', 'The Amazon River, which crosses several countries, supports many ecosystems.', 'The Amazon River which crosses several countries, supports many ecosystems.', 'The Amazon River, which crosses several countries supports many ecosystems.', 'The Amazon River which, crosses several countries supports many ecosystems.', 'A', '2', 'Mệnh đề không xác định bổ sung thông tin về tên riêng và phải có dấu phẩy hai bên.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('368', '62', 'G9-U10-GRA-01-Q07', 'Which version correctly presents an extra fact about my aunt, a person already identified?', 'My aunt who works at the national park, studies rare birds.', 'My aunt, who works at the national park studies rare birds.', 'My aunt who, works at the national park, studies rare birds.', 'My aunt, who works at the national park, studies rare birds.', 'D', '2', 'My aunt đã xác định; mệnh đề who works... là bổ sung thông tin, cần hai dấu phẩy.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('369', '62', 'G9-U10-GRA-01-Q08', 'Mai has one brother. He is a marine biologist. Which sentence uses punctuation to show that the relative clause adds non-essential information?', 'Mai''s brother who is a marine biologist, studies coral reefs.', 'Mai''s brother, who is a marine biologist studies coral reefs.', 'Mai''s brother who, is a marine biologist, studies coral reefs.', 'Mai''s brother, who is a marine biologist, studies coral reefs.', 'D', '3', 'Vì chỉ có một anh trai, mệnh đề quan hệ là thông tin không xác định; phải được ngăn bằng hai dấu phẩy.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
('372', '63', 'G9-U10-GRA-02-Q03', 'Lan, ____ mother is a scientist, loves biology.', 'that', 'who', 'whose', 'which', 'C', '1', 'Đáp án C: whose. Dùng theo phạm vi: Chọn who/which/whose trong mệnh đề quan hệ không xác định; không dùng that.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
