('383', '64', 'G9-U10-GRA-03-Q06', 'Ha Long Bay is a famous natural wonder. It attracts visitors from around the world. Choose the correct combination.', 'Ha Long Bay, which attracts visitors from around the world, is a famous natural wonder.', 'Ha Long Bay, that attracts visitors from around the world, is a famous natural wonder.', 'Ha Long Bay, which it attracts visitors from around the world, is a famous natural wonder.', 'Ha Long Bay which attracts visitors from around the world is a famous natural wonder.', 'A', '2', 'Which dùng cho địa danh trong mệnh đề không xác định, có hai dấu phẩy, không lặp it.', 'Active', 'ForTest'),
